e_jianti_auto":"阳平郡","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9e6714c9-db0e-11ef-bad2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9e6714ca-db0e-11ef-a23d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨清縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"临清县","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"9e6714cb-db0e-11ef-9223-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9e6714cc-db0e-11ef-b76f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨清縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"临清县","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9e6714cd-db0e-11ef-8b17-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清淵","place_name_jianti_auto":"清渊","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"9e6714ce-db0e-11ef-b36d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"9e6714cf-db0e-11ef-9a50-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"清淵","place_name_jianti_auto":"清渊","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"9e6714d0-db0e-11ef-a881-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨清","place_name_jianti_auto":"临清","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"9e6714d1-db0e-11ef-92f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"貝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"贝州","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"9e6714d2-db0e-11ef-9087-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"清淵縣，漢屬魏郡。應劭曰：清河在縣西北。晉屬陽平郡，後魏分置臨清縣；後齊廢臨清縣入清淵。唐避高祖諱，改清淵爲臨清，屬貝州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"清渊县，汉属魏郡。应劭曰：清河在县西北。晋属阳平郡，后魏分置临清县；后齐废临清县入清渊。唐避高祖讳，改清渊为临清，属贝州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9e6714c1-db0e-11ef-82ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"清淵","place_name_jianti_auto":"清渊","resolved_place_entity_id":7952,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9e6979c7-db0e-11ef-8384-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○崇武驿，在府东门外，运河西岸，为往来孔道，置水马驿于此...","context_before":"...《史记》：晋赵鞅伐齐，至赖而去。谓此。又赤桥，在府西北。","source_end_index":84,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"22ddc3ed-074a-5d64-b5e2-18a564e5660b","source_start_index":41,"source_text":"晋永嘉中，苟晞等破汲桑、石勒于清渊，桑等西奔刘渊。冀州刺史丁绍邀击之于赤桥，桑等败走。"},{"context_after":"后魏仍属阳平郡。北齐属清河郡。隋属贝州。唐避讳，改曰清水...","context_before":"清渊城[在县北。汉县，属魏郡。晋属阳平郡。","source_end_index":47,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"291b0fed-e95e-56d4-84d9-fdc7259d8994","source_start_index":21,"source_text":"永嘉初，苟晞击破群盗汲桑于东武阳，桑退保清渊，是也。"},{"context_after":"是也。升平二年，泰山太守诸葛攸攻燕东郡，入武阳，寻败还。...","context_before":"...守，亦治东武阳。袁绍围洪，洪死之。今围郭尚存，环水匝隍。","source_end_index":124,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ba91fc78-2d5b-50d3-ad4c-acb8c7cb0150","source_start_index":104,"source_text":"晋永嘉初，兖州刺史苟晞破盗汲桑于东武阳。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/四、东昌府（卷三十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"14八月，己卯朔，苟晞擊汲桑於東武陽，大破之。桑退保清淵。","content_fanyi":"八月初一己卯朔，苟晞在东武阳向汲桑发起进攻，大败汲桑。汲桑退到清渊据守。","content_jianti_auto":"14八月，己卯朔，苟晞击汲桑于东武阳，大破之。桑退保清渊。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7357,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第八十六 (晉紀八) / 孝懷皇帝上 / 永嘉元年 / 第 18 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"9e6714ae-db0e-11ef-9753-a0d3651f611f","year_int":307},"tongjian_id":"9e6714ae-db0e-11ef-9753-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"清淵"},"message":"success","success":true}